 if there were a way to determine which campaigns would be extremely successful \u2013 and could theoretically be even more successful with the right publicity on their end \u2013 Kickstarter would find this information extremely valuable. We could also provide a service to a prospective user of a crowdfunding campaign, on ways that they can optimize their campaign itself to give themselves the best chance of being successful.","topics":[],"score":180118,"global_rank":404743},{"name":"burcu-erkan/hover-time","owner":"burcu-erkan","html_url":"https://github.com/burcu-erkan/hover-time","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Created with CodeSandbox","topics":[],"score":180118,"global_rank":404744},{"name":"berndverst/berndverst","owner":"berndverst","html_url":"https://github.com/berndverst/berndverst","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"GitHub Profile Page for Bernd Verst (@berndverst)","topics":[],"score":180118,"global_rank":404745},{"name":"mi4l/Zero","owner":"mi4l","html_url":"https://github.com/mi4l/Zero","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"TODO app for desktop/mobile","topics":[],"score":180118,"global_rank":404746},{"name":"TerminalWitchcraft/TerminalWitchcraft","owner":"TerminalWitchcraft","html_url":"https://github.com/TerminalWitchcraft/TerminalWitchcraft","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"My public Readme","topics":[],"score":180118,"global_rank":404747},{"name":"Cofeight/portfolio-hw","owner":"Cofeight","html_url":"https://github.com/Cofeight/portfolio-hw","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180118,"global_rank":404748},{"name":"noey2020/How-to-Talk-Screening-Stocks","owner":"noey2020","html_url":"https://github.com/noey2020/How-to-Talk-Screening-Stocks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","descripti